= Traffic flow

Traffic flow\ix{traffic!flow} relates speed\ix{speed}, density\ix{traffic!density} and
flow\ix[bold]{flow} through the fundamental diagram\ix{fundamental diagram}.
At high densities a jam\ix{traffic!density!jam} forms.

= Queues

A queue\ix{queueing}\ix[see="queueing"]{waiting lines} grows when arrivals exceed
the service rate\ix{queueing!service rate}. Ortúzar\ix{Ortúzar, Juan de Dios} and
Willumsen\ix{Willumsen, Luis G.} discuss both\ix[see-also="queueing"]{traffic}.

